  "steps": [
    "Invalid targets and unchanged duration preserve reviewed bytes, paused sample time and form values. Unchanged retiming also leaves a running preview active. Editing the independent target alone does not invalidate the review. Chinese, English and Japanese at390px retain the target node, incomplete text, focus and selection; controls fit. Cancel leaves all author files and source draft unchanged.",
    "Real Rust WASM halves the current valid schema3 form from2s to1s, including every key on sprite and numeric tracks and both named-clip ranges. Unsaved numeric values and clip names survive; IDs, grid, interpolation and loops remain equal. The result stays in fields until a new check/review. The schematic clip range becomes0.5s and its first sample is the expected sprite frame. Cancelling the transformed review writes nothing.",
    "Apply updates only the ordinary source draft. Ordinary Save writes exactly the reviewed BOM/CRLF animation and preserves every scene, registration, asset, template and other author file.",
    "Saved scene preview freezes the exact retimed document and exposes the same stable clip with its shortened0.5s range. Preview and inspection cause no additional author writes. No browser exceptions occurred."
  ],
